  "question": {
    "text": "A freshly prepared sample of a radioisotope of half-life 1386 s&nbsp;has activity ${10}^{3}$ disintegrations per second. Given that In 2 = 0.693, the fraction of the initial number of nuclei (expressed in nearest integer percentage) that will decay in the first 80 s after preparation of the sample is"
  },
