  "correct_answer": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mrow>  <mtext>f</mtext>  <mo>=</mo>  <mfenced open=\"(\" close=\")\" separators=\",\">    <mrow>      <mn>1</mn>      <mo>-</mo>      <msup>              <mtext>e</mtext>          <mrow>            <mo>-</mo>            <mi>&lambda;</mi>            <mtext>t</mtext>          </mrow>      </msup>    </mrow>  </mfenced>  <mo>=</mo>  <mn>1</mn>  <mo>-</mo>  <msup>          <mtext>e</mtext>      <mrow>        <mo>-</mo>        <mi>&lambda;</mi>        <mtext>t</mtext>      </mrow>  </msup>  <mo>&asymp;</mo>  <mn>1</mn>  <mo>-</mo>  <mfenced open=\"(\" close=\")\" separators=\",\">    <mrow>      <mn>1</mn>      <mo>-</mo>      <mi>&lambda;</mi>      <mtext>t</mtext>    </mrow>  </mfenced>  <mo>=</mo>  <mi>&lambda;</mi>  <mtext>t</mtext></mrow></math><br>f = 0.04<br>Hence&nbsp;<math><mrow>  <mtext>%</mtext>  <mo>decay&nbsp;</mo>  <mo>&asymp;&nbsp;</mo>  <mn>4</mn>  <mo>%</mo></mrow></math>"
  }
